      "text": "To solve this problem, we need to determine the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan using the given exchange rates. \n\nStep 1: Convert the cost of the painting from Namibian dollars to US dollars using the given exchange rate:\ncost of painting in US dollars = cost of painting in Namibian dollars / exchange rate from Namibian to US\n                                = 105 Namibian dollars / 7 Namibian dollars/U.S. dollar\n                                = 15 US dollars\n\nStep 2: Convert the cost of the painting from US dollars to Chinese yuan using the given exchange rate:\ncost of painting in Chinese yuan = cost of painting in US dollars * exchange rate from US to Chinese\n                                 = 15 US dollars * 6 Chinese yuan/US dollar\n                                 = 90 Chinese yuan\n\nFinal answer: The cost of the painting is \\boxed{90} Chinese yuan.",
