      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "To determine the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to convert the price from Namibian dollars to US dollars first, and then convert the resulting amount from US dollars to Chinese yuan. Here is the step-by-step process:\n\n1. Convert the price from Namibian dollars to US dollars.\n2. Convert the price from US dollars to Chinese yuan.\n\nFirst, we convert the painting's price from Namibian dollars to US dollars. The painting costs 105 Namibian dollars and we know that 1 US dollar is equivalent to 7 Namibian dollars. Therefore, the cost in US dollars is:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Cost in US dollars} = \\frac{105 \\text{ Namibian dollars}}{7 \\text{ Namibian dollars per US dollar}} = 15 \\text{ US dollars}\n\\]\n\nNext, we convert the cost from US dollars to Chinese yuan. We know that 1 US dollar is equivalent to 6 Chinese yuan. Therefore, the cost in Chinese yuan is:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Cost in Chinese yuan} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\times 6 \\text{ Chinese yuan per US dollar} = 90 \\text{ Chinese yuan}\n\\]\n\nSo, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is:\n\n\\boxed{90}",
